    "image_with_usp_EhKMWR": {
      "type": "image-with-usp",
      "blocks": {
        "heading_TpnfJV": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Meet Our Founder",
            "heading_flourish": false,
            "heading_underline": "pistachio"
          }
        },
        "text_cHQze3": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Having worked for some time in various wine roles in the UK, Pippa got a chance to spend some time in Australia, again working in wine. Whilst she was there, she took the opportunity to explore New Zealand and immediately became hooked – you know – love at first sight kind of hooked!</p><p>And of course, who could blame her? New Zealand is simply breathtaking—there’s no other way to put it. Nature went all out there. And it’s not just about the views. The people are incredibly warm and welcoming, and there's a real sense of adventure everywhere you go. The indigenous Māori culture is deeply rooted in a profound connection to the land, an ethos which echoes throughout the winemaking regions. </p><p>And let’s not forget the spectacular wine regions, which stretch 1000 miles from subtropical Northland to Central Otago, home to the world’s most southerly vineyards.</p><p>Pippa’s next step became a simple one: to share her love of New Zealand wines and the commitment and skill of those making them. And so, on landing back in the UK, she founded Kiwi Cru.</p><p>Since then, she’s been able to talk some talented people into joining her….</p>"
          }
        },
        "button_eUgJCJ": {
          "type": "button",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "button_label": "Find Out More",
            "button_link": "/",
            "button_style": "btn--primary",
            "button_size": ""
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
