    "multicolumn_9didmf": {
      "type": "multicolumn",
      "blocks": {
        "column_GBjW3x": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Lara-Sayegh_square.jpg",
            "mobile_image": "shopify://shop_images/Lara-Sayegh_square.jpg",
            "image_link": "",
            "title": "Lara",
            "heading_size": "h4",
            "text": "<p>Lara is the e-commerce guru behind our online wine shop, making sure it looks great, runs smoothly, and ordering your favourite bottle is quick and easy. </p><p>Her ‘Tasting notes’? Well, she’s <strong>‘beautifully structured, elegant and well balanced’ </strong>sums her up!</p>",
            "button_text": "",
            "button_link": "",
            "button_style": "btn--underline"
          }
        },
        "column_CcMDxY": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/ash_headshot_56205261-309f-432c-8cd4-0fb4d9e2a303.jpg",
            "mobile_image": "shopify://shop_images/ash_headshot_56205261-309f-432c-8cd4-0fb4d9e2a303.jpg",
            "image_link": "",
            "title": "Ash",
            "heading_size": "h4",
            "text": "<p>As a Kiwi living in London, Ash is a huge champion for the wines of her homeland. Luckily for us, all that enthusiasm finds its way into all things social at Kiwi Cru.  </p><p>If she were a wine, we reckon she’d be a Riesling – <strong>bright, lively, and ‘sweet as’</strong>… </p>",
            "button_text": "",
            "button_link": "",
            "button_style": "btn--underline"
          }
        },
        "column_Qbpfcg": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Greta_Codyre_fb40f54b-d41c-4e49-a681-963ce6b53402.jpg",
            "mobile_image": "shopify://shop_images/Greta_Codyre_fb40f54b-d41c-4e49-a681-963ce6b53402.jpg",
            "image_link": "",
            "title": "Greta",
            "heading_size": "h4",
            "text": "<p>Greta’s also a Kiwi but living in sunny Perth. Having worked in wineries across the world, she’s now blending all that experience with her knack for storytelling, so that every email is engaging. </p><p>What type of wine might she be? Definitely a <strong>super versatile, and<br/>full of life </strong>Sauvignon Blanc.</p>",
            "button_text": "",
            "button_link": "",
            "button_style": "btn--underline"
          }
        },
        "column_QQHC9k": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/WhatsApp_Image_2025-03-24_at_10.33.19_1_eaf5a418-26f2-4ac2-a52d-9fcad01ffbea.jpg",
            "mobile_image": "shopify://shop_images/WhatsApp_Image_2025-03-24_at_10.33.19_1_eaf5a418-26f2-4ac2-a52d-9fcad01ffbea.jpg",
            "image_link": "",
            "title": "Alice",
            "heading_size": "h4",
            "text": "<p>Alice connects our Kiwi Cru community in the real world through tasting events, pop-ups and partnerships, just about anywhere she can find an excuse to enjoy delicious NZ wine.</p><p>Alice's favourite wines arealways<strong> dry, </strong>though we definitely wouldn’t say the same about her personality!</p>",
            "button_text": "",
            "button_link": "",
            "button_style": "btn--underline"
          }
        }
      },
